---
// Quiz figure for Post 5: Rights issue 2:1 at 10,000 VND when stock is 25,000 VND.
---
<div class="qfig-sbq05rig">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 185" role="img" aria-label="Rights issue 2:1 at 10,000 VND for an investor holding 2,000 shares at 25,000 VND: reference price becomes 20,000 VND on Ex-Date.">
    <text x="16" y="24" class="qfig-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Rights issue 2:1 at 10,000 đ (2,000 shares held @ 25,000 đ)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Quyền mua 2:1 giá 10.000 đ (đang giữ 2.000 CP giá 25.000 đ)</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="16" y="46" width="262" height="120" rx="8" class="qfig-card" />
    <text x="32" y="74" class="qfig-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Exercise 1,000 new shares</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Nộp 10 triệu mua 1.000 CP mới</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="32" y="102">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Outlay: +10,000,000 đ cash</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Chi thêm: +10.000.000 đ tiền mặt</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="32" y="130">3,000 CP × 20,000 = 60,000,000</text>
    <text x="32" y="154" class="qfig-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Stake % kept unchanged</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Giữ nguyên tỷ lệ sở hữu</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="302" y="46" width="262" height="120" rx="8" class="qfig-card-red" />
    <text x="318" y="74" class="qfig-t qfig-red">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Ignore &amp; miss deadline</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Bỏ mặc quá hạn nộp tiền</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="318" y="102">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Ex-Date ref STILL drops to 20k</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Giá tham chiếu VẪN tụt về 20k</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="318" y="130">2,000 CP × 20,000 = 40,000,000</text>
    <text x="318" y="154" class="qfig-t qfig-red">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Unrecovered gap = −10M</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Thiệt hại tức thì = −10 triệu</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-sbq05rig { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-sbq05rig svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-sbq05rig text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .qfig-sbq05rig .qfig-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-sbq05rig .qfig-t { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-sbq05rig .qfig-m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-sbq05rig .qfig-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .qfig-sbq05rig .qfig-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .qfig-sbq05rig .qfig-card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
</style>
